<title>CANADA: Berkley enters C$32.75 mln agreement.</title>
<headline>Berkley enters C$32.75 mln agreement.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berkley Petroleum Corp said on Tuesday it entered into a &quot;bought deal&quot; financing arrangement with underwriters to issue one million common shares from treasury worth C$32.75 each for a total of C$32.75 million.</p>
<p>The deal will close on May 22 or earlier.</p>
<p>The funds will be used to fund Berkley's energy exploration and development programs.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
